{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Vision</strong> is an atmospheric indie horror game where the player finds themselves trapped in a mysterious and hostile dimension. Here, space is distorted, environments shift, and every mistake can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore unsettling locations, solve puzzles, and search for a path to freedom, relying on your perception, reflexes, and ability to adapt to a constantly changing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014560/extras/f13163eb46d0e81638fc94c940fa6ac2.avif?t=1769326508\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric horror full of tension</strong><br>Dark environments, unsettling sounds, and a constant feeling of unease follow you at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Dynamic levels</strong><br>The environment can change as you progress, creating the sense of an unstable and living reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Puzzles and deadly traps</strong><br>You\u2019ll need more than courage \u2014 observe carefully, think fast, and avoid lethal mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Minimalistic yet expressive visual style</strong><br>Distorted space and lighting enhance the feeling of anxiety and disorientation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Controller and multiple language support</strong><br>Play using different control methods with support for multiple languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Are you ready to escape?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step can bring you closer to freedom \u2014 or lead to your demise.<br><strong>Creepy Vision</strong> will test how long you can keep your composure in a world that doesn\u2019t want you to leave.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"9cc95fbfdc25949ba65a135e893d6bdd463531ff.jpg","localized_name":"Plumber","name":"Plumber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014560/9cc95fbfdc25949ba65a135e893d6bdd463531ff.jpg"},{"icon":"e3b5c6f9fb100d69c79645e00b93ace7733e8264.jpg","localized_name":"Disco dancer","name":"Disco dancer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014560/e3b5c6f9fb100d69c79645e00b93ace7733e8264.jpg"},{"icon":"8ab478d37924fab6a875ab1574d8c6f3201dd6f1.jpg","localized_name":"Outer space","name":"Outer space","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014560/8ab478d37924fab6a875ab1574d8c6f3201dd6f1.jpg"},{"icon":"19666ef3e72f73324c6142349c926fa016173913.jpg","localized_name":"Detective","name":"Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014560/19666ef3e72f73324c6142349c926fa016173913.jpg"},{"icon":"5e86b49250e3d669ba97aac8e9fa164481cfa6c7.jpg","localized_name":"Fighter","name":"Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014560/5e86b49250e3d669ba97aac8e9fa164481cfa6c7.jpg"},{"icon":"e36902d318f5208a753e7cbc6c1b6c7ca0be35af.jpg","localized_name":"Claustrophobia","name":"Claustrophobia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014560/e36902d318f5208a753e7cbc6c1b6c7ca0be35af.jpg"},{"icon":"7dd8406756939adf8ed6124ce17285a372287c6d.jpg","localized_name":"Boatman","name":"Boatman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014560/7dd8406756939adf8ed6124ce17285a372287c6d.jpg"},{"icon":"79e5f14a7617ad13357a8af0c15d56352c7fd705.jpg","localized_name":"Nintendo","name":"Nintendo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014560/79e5f14a7617ad13357a8af0c15d56352c7fd705.jpg"},{"icon":"7b2af893d503f12fa34b4b4207e49e85c06c8f8a.jpg","localized